### Agent config: the rules, skills, subagents, hooks, Codex and opencode configs and tools/ are tracked; ###
### only per-machine files stay out: personal overrides, local permissions, IDEA's .mcp.json and secrets ###
/CLAUDE.local.md
/.claude/settings.local.json
/.claude/worktrees/
/.mcp.json
/AGENTS.override.md
/opencode.jsonc
/.opencode/
/.agents/
.env.local
reference/
rules/

